{"id":"n68121-1-9","stage":0,"title":"외국 · 外国","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68121-1-9-1","ko":"승규야, 외국으로 유학을 간다면서?","zh":"承奎，听说你要去国外留学？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"외국으로","meaning":"外国","explanation":"외국：外国；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"외국","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유학을","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6ea4544c8e190594","term":"외국","zh":"外国","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3","entryId":"68121","definition":"本国以外的国家。","pronunciation":["외ː국","웨ː국"]},{"id":"4c52a19db898d399","term":"유학","zh":"留学","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3","entryId":"70244","definition":"在外国生活并学习。","pronunciation":["유학"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f251f545c2332743f14c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68121-1-9-2","ko":"네. 미국으로 가요.","zh":"是的，我要去美国。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미국으로","meanin